        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Five_Points%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1887 along the East Alabama Railway, the town moved to its present location where the same rail line still runs.",
